<h2>FAQ</h2>

<details><summary>How long should it take to edit a 10-minute YouTube video?</summary>
<p>For a talking-head video with B-roll and basic graphics: 3-5 hours for a beginner, 1.5-2.5 hours for an experienced editor. A heavily produced mini-documentary style video can take 8-15 hours. The ratio is roughly 2-3 hours of editing per 1 minute of finished content for polished work.</p>
</details>

<details><summary>Should I edit in 1080p or 4K for YouTube?</summary>
<p>If your camera shoots 4K and your computer can handle it — edit in 4K. YouTube gives higher bitrate to 4K uploads, so even viewers watching at 1080p see a better image. If your computer struggles with 4K, use proxy workflows or edit in 1080p — the quality difference on YouTube is minimal for most content types.</p>
</details>

<details><summary>What's the best free software for YouTube editing in 2026?</summary>
<p>DaVinci Resolve Free. It's not even close. You get professional-grade editing, color grading, audio mixing (Fairlight), and visual effects (Fusion) — all free, no watermark, no time limit. The only reason to use something else is if Resolve is too complex for your needs, in which case CapCut Desktop is excellent for simpler content.</p>
</details>

<details><summary>How do I make my YouTube edits look more professional?</summary>
<p>Three things make the biggest difference: (1) clean audio with no background noise, (2) consistent color/exposure across cuts, and (3) purposeful pacing — every cut has a reason. Fancy transitions and effects are usually signs of a beginner editor trying to compensate. The best YouTube edits are invisible — the viewer focuses on the content, not the editing.</p>
</details>

<details><summary>Should I add subtitles/captions to every YouTube video?</summary>
<p>Yes. YouTube's algorithm indexes captions for search ranking, and 80%+ of mobile viewers watch with sound off at least sometimes. Use CapCut or Premiere's auto-transcription to generate them, then manually correct errors. It takes 15-20 minutes and significantly boosts your reach.</p>
</details>

